The tiles are so cute!

594
00:33:00,830 --> 00:33:07,560
The tiles are cute!

595
00:33:07,560 --> 00:33:12,540
Standing on your tiles like this, huh.

596
00:33:12,540 --> 00:33:13,020
Hahaha!

597
00:33:13,020 --> 00:33:15,740
Hahaha!

598
00:33:15,740 --> 00:33:26,030
