611
00:34:26,600 --> 00:34:34,290
It's so frustrating, like what was the anomaly? This is right, right? This is right, right?

612
00:34:34,290 --> 00:34:39,480
Okay, I'm going in.

613
00:34:39,480 --> 00:34:44,230
Yes, correct. Alright!

614
00:34:44,230 --> 00:34:50,990
So I'm going back in from 0 again. Was the no-smoking poster here?

615
