00:49:21,490 --> 00:49:29,940
10 more.

846
00:49:29,940 --> 00:49:31,700
10 more.

847
00:49:31,700 --> 00:49:33,400
10 more.

848
00:49:33,400 --> 00:49:35,420
10 more.

